Use native musl, musl-bsd source compatibility, and Vesk on musl.
Vesk owns random generation and secure-free; musl owns explicit_bzero and
reallocarray. Passphrase input links from the hidden PIC source archive,
never the musl-bsd foreign-binary host. No libbsd or bundled fallback.

